# Local (`dotnet run`): porta 5079.
# Docker com `--scale`: a porta e sorteada por replica — veja `docker compose ps`.
@worker = http://localhost:5079

### Saude da instancia (mostra qual worker respondeu)
GET {{worker}}/health

### Status da ultima execucao do job
GET {{worker}}/jobs/billing-close/status

### Disparar o job agora (pode executar em outra instancia do cluster)
POST {{worker}}/jobs/billing-close/run-now

### Repor faturas pendentes para uma nova demonstracao
POST {{worker}}/invoices/seed?count=25
